# Enterprise traceability

> Canonical: `D:\Obsidian\Obsidian\00_Brain\Conventions\Architecture Decision Records.md`

## Decision records

- Architectural or 3+ file changes → IDN with `adr_id` (ADR-YYYY-NNN).
- On ship: update IDN status, Verification evidence, **Decision Register** row, Feature note link.

## Audits (before publish / session close)

Run from `data/harness-verify.yaml` → `repo_checks`:

- `npm run audit:facts` (or `node scripts/run-facts-gate.mjs`)

## Traceability chain

ADR/IDN → Feature note → Session note → Git commit → Deploy tag → Verification write-back.
